# An allowlist: the image is built from the two apps' sources only. Local installs, build
# and test output and every env file stay out of the build context.
*
!apps/web
!apps/api
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-e2e
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/playwright-pwa-report
**/.env*
**/.postgres.env
**/*.csv
**/*.dump
**/*.sql
